Subject: [PATCH] fix(block-entities): render paired Bedrock chests

Bedrock stores the adjacent half in chest block entity pairx/pairz tags, while its block palette does not include a chest type. Derive the Java left or right state from those coordinates and the mapped facing for regular, trapped, and copper chests.
---
